## Smart Investor — Local Properties Configuration Template
## Copy this file to `local.properties` and populate with your own credentials.
## NEVER commit your real `local.properties` file to version control.

## Android SDK Location (Auto-generated by Android Studio)
## sdk.dir=C\:\\Users\\YourUsername\\AppData\\Local\\Android\\Sdk

## Google Gemini API
## Obtain from: https://aistudio.google.com/
GEMINI_API_KEY=YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY_HERE

## Supabase Backend & Database
## Obtain from: https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/_/settings/api
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_supabase_anon_public_key_here

## Finnhub Market Data API
## Obtain from: https://finnhub.io/
FINNHUB_API_KEY=your_finnhub_api_key_here
